WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:23.500
We were kind to him,
and this is how he repays us?

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:27.580
Unforgivable.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.420
Silence, Kazuma.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:30.340
But...

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.960
Hatred is like willingly ingesting poison.

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:36.590
Eventually, it will create a Busoma.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:39.760
<i>Gai, I pity you.</i>

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:43.520
<i>So your fate with the Shiryu
<i>cannot be broken?</i></i>

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.480
<i>Then I shall end your life myself.</i>

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:54.780
Where did you go?

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:56.240
Gai!

00:01:58.950 --> 00:01:59.780
Gai!

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:01.990
Wait!

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:04.540
Don't leave me!

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:14.800
What's wrong, Gai?

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:20.760
Somebody's walking around out here?

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:23.640
They can't be hiking...

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:38.990
Gai!

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:42.410
Gai, wait!

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:44.580
Wait, Gai!

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:47.830
Gai!

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:56.380
How is it doing?

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:59.300
No problems. It's stable.

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:08.560
<i>The Prismaphon.</i>

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:10.770
<i>We've waited so long for it.</i>

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:13.730
<i>Now I can see my father again.</i>

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:19.990
Our long battle with the Busoma...

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:23.700
With this, we can change that history.

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:37.590
It's okay.

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:41.090
I'm back... I'm back to normal.

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:44.260
Mr. Shin!

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:47.430
Are you all right?

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.270
Y-Yes.

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:51.730
I just had a weird dream.

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:53.810
I see.

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:56.440
You seemed tired last night.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:59.650
Shall I call the school
and tell them you won't be coming?

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:02.780
I'm alright. I'll get ready.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:08.990
The weather's nice again, huh?

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:11.500
Maybe we'll do more outdoor painting.

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.040
Yeah, maybe.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:21.260
If we do, well...
How about you come paint with me?

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:25.090
Yeah, maybe.

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:27.100
Um, Ogata.

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:30.850
Um... Oh yeah!

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:33.100
-I saw him the other day!
-Him?

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:37.730
You know, the guy who saved us
when we were attacked in the park.

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:39.860
You mean Gai?

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:41.070
Yes.

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:43.950
That's impossible.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.070
Gai is...

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:49.120
I'm sure of it.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:51.910
Where?

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:53.750
Where did you see him?

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:56.120
What's gotten into you?

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.420
Matoba, please, tell me.

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:01.420
It's extremely important to me.

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:03.170
Important?

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:04.170
That's right.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:08.140
So I'm not important.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.520
What's your relationship with him?

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:16.020
He said he wasn't your little brother.
Was he your boyfriend?

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:17.850
No.

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:23.360
Listen, we're... dating, right?

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:26.570
Well...

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:29.320
Don't tell me you love him.

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:36.920
Then what? What was that kiss?

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.960
Would you do that
with someone you didn't love?

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.850
Sorry, I have to go.

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:02.110
Yo, Matoba...

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:06.360
Can you go fight with your girlfriend
at a love hotel or something?

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:10.370
It's a bother to us hard-working students.

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:12.990
Maybe you should pay up
for bothering us.

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:21.210
-Hey, don't igno--
-Let go!

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:25.460
You--

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:29.630
Take this!

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:42.110
No... It was supposed to be fixed.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.400
Why?

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:49.320
<i>Requesting Chrysalis support from HQ.</i>

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:55.160
<i>Alpha 0301, Alpha 0403, and Alpha 0502.</i>

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:57.120
<i>Release from cold sleep.</i>

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:04.630
What a pain.

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:07.420
Your mission is to take down the Busoma.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.840
Your opponent is Zsoltgewinn.
Head there immediately.

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:12.390
Roger.

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:15.140
<i>I can't catch a break.</i>

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:18.890
Apostolo 3,
permission to use the Prismaphon.

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:20.190
Denied.

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:21.390
Why?

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:24.190
With the anti-busoma weapons
having failed,

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:27.280
the Prismaphone is the only way
to defeat Zsoltgewinn!

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:32.490
Are you just going
to let more Chrysalises die?

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:35.200
You should already be aware of this.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:39.580
Zsoltgewinn, Takuma Miura,
is an embarrassment to the Shoshidai.

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:43.710
He must die as a Busoma,
no matter what.

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:04.520
It was impossible after all.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:08.440
Administrator Kagami, what are you doing?

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:10.190
Did you get permission?

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:12.200
I'm afraid...

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:16.450
There are places in this lab we'd prefer
that even you stay out of, administrator.

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:19.040
I do have permission.

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:21.000
I see.

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:23.960
Then please allow me to confirm.

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:27.590
This is my only option, then.

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:57.490
Too weak. This isn't even a warm-up.

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:00.490
Damn it! Don't underestimate me!

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:02.700
Zsoltgewinn!

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:06.420
Give back my father's body!

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:10.750
Did you think that would hit?

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:14.010
Hey you!

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:17.300
We're not done here!

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:21.720
Don't mess with Issei Ariga!

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:28.770
That look...

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:32.940
It's becoming more to my liking.

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:35.610
Nebestigma!

00:09:56.510 --> 00:09:57.680
Too easy.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:07.140
Fool. Did you think this
would work on me?

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:12.400
Wh-What?

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:13.840
<i>Kill.</i>

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:34.770
<i>Kill!</i>

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:41.910
<i>Kill!</i>

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:48.540
<i>Kill!</i>

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:57.500
Welcome home, honey.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:58.920
I'm back.

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:00.260
Daddy!

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:03.090
Welcome home!

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:05.470
Thanks, Kyoka.

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:19.940
My wife is everything to me.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:31.330
Without her, I'm an incomplete person.

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:36.420
With her, I finally become whole.

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.710
Man, you say that
like it's nothing, Miura.

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:44.760
It's surprising to see you so in love.

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:51.640
Take care of her. It's not often you get
to think of someone like that.

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:54.640
Never let her go.
Protect her no matter what.

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:57.270
You don't need to tell me.

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:02.360
Can you do something
about that attitude, though?

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:05.030
I'm older than you, after all.

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:07.120
But I'm your boss.

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:48.320
<i>I couldn't protect what I loved.</i>

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:50.990
Mommy!

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:58.000
<i>I was powerless.</i>

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:06.800
<i>I wanted power.</i>

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:10.760
<i>So that I would never have
<i>to lose anything again.</i></i>

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:54.640
Where am I?

00:14:57.890 --> 00:15:00.770
It can't be... Kyoka?

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:02.860
Is that you, Kyoka?

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:10.410
How long has it been?

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:12.910
Sixteen years.

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:18.790
I see.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:22.540
You look just like your mother.

00:15:25.590 --> 00:15:26.460
Father...

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:31.050
Welcome back... Father!

00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:52.490
Administrator Kagami,
step away from Zsoltgewinn!

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:54.780
Wait. Hold on!

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:57.540
He is... Takuma Miura is human!

00:15:57.990 --> 00:15:58.830
Human?

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.250
I used the Prismaphon.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:03.670
You can confirm back at Shoshidai HQ.

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:05.420
Zsoltgewinn is gone!

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:07.460
What evidence do you have?

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:09.630
I won't resist.

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:12.180
I'll follow the Shoshidai's orders.

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:22.640
You'll both be taken to the Shoshidai.

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:29.070
It'll be okay, Father.

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:31.940
Once they see you're human,
even the Shoshidai...

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:34.780
No. I'm prepared.

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:37.830
I've done many awful things.

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:43.330
No. I finally get to see you!
Don't say that, Father!

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:45.670
Kyoka, don't cry.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:49.050
I'm truly happy I can die as a human.

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:51.170
I'm grateful to you.

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:53.510
Roger.

00:16:57.890 --> 00:16:58.760
Please get out.

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:00.520
That was awfully fast.

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:07.020
Father!

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:09.070
Are you okay Father?

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:09.980
Yeah.

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:11.690
What are you thinking?

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:14.530
Takuma Miura. No, Zsoltgewinn.

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:16.740
You're going to die here.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:19.240
It's fine, Kyoka.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:20.490
Father!

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:23.160
Administrator Kagami, I'm sorry...

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:26.620
But the Shoshidai cannot allow
even a single traitor.

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:30.340
Father!

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:32.460
I'm sorry, Kyoka.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:34.470
We have to do it.

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:38.090
I'll create an opening.
Don't do anything stupid.

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:40.010
It's fine. Leave it to me.

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:57.410
Let's go, Father!

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:02.990
Father!

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:04.410
Father!

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:07.920
Are you okay? Hang in there!

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:12.420
Kyoka... Get away from me!

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.300
No! Please, Father--

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:35.030
Why...

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:39.070
This body is mine.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:41.280
Forever.

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:46.040
Wait...

00:18:47.460 --> 00:18:48.330
Father...

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:57.630
No! Wait!

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:09.940
Daddy, don't go!

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:13.020
Wait!

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:15.190
Wait!

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:42.510
Humanity's destruction has finally begun.

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:45.640
Tremble and scream with fear, humans.

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:48.720
Shake with despair!

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:53.310
This is the power of the Busoshin.

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:59.610
You cannot fight your destiny
towards extinction.

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:07.120
Gai!

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:12.540
Don't leave me all alone.

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:16.590
Gai.

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:21.630
The man called Gai
is gone from this body.

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:23.180
No...

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:27.720
Perfect. I was getting tired
of playing with humans.

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:36.060
Gai! Stop it!

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:37.820
Please!

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:50.750
Gai.

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:56.040
M-My first... and only friend.

00:20:57.210 --> 00:21:00.590
Give Gai back! Give him back!
